      "title": "Administrative responsibilities",
      "items": [
        "Issue one-time enrollment, bind the immutable Entra and GitHub identities, and revoke access.",
        "Reconcile approved users and Claude model routes in LiteLLM.",
        "Keep administration separate from the employee inference request path."
